:3; invoking function 'main'; `sync func @main(%input0: tensor<4xf32>, %input1: tensor<4xf32>) -> (%output0: tensor<4xf32>)`\n```\n\nBut it works with f32\n```\n$ iree-run-module --module=./simple_mul.vmfb --input=4xf32=[1,2,3,4] --input=4xf32=[10,20,30,40]\nEXEC @main\nresult[0]: hal.buffer_view\n4xf32=10 40 90 160\n```\n\nI tested also changing all types to f16, then running the module does expect f16 tensors, same for f32.\n\n\n### What component(s) does this issue relate to?\n\n_No response_\n\n### Version information\n\n3.3.0\n\n### Additional context\n\n_No response_","closed_at":"2025-05-12T16:46:14Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75337?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benvanik","id":75337,"login":"benvanik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MzM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":3,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/20774/comments","created_at":"2025-05-11T15:05:24Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/20774/events","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/20774","id":3055042159,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_b